{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20254","headline":"吊卢殷 八 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前贤多哭酒，哭酒免哭心。\n後贤试衔之，哀至无不深。\n少年哭酒时，白发亦已侵。\n老年哭酒时，声韵随生沈。\n寄言哭酒宾，勿作登封音。\n登封徒放声，天地竟难寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}